    "created_at": "2017-04-21T05:15:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-21T05:15:03Z",
    "body": "WebKit/Blink simply have no code at all that can do https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#unicode-serialisation-of-an-origin right now, so any time they serialize an origin they always do https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#ascii-serialisation-of-an-origin no matter what the spec says.\r\n\r\nWe definitely need tests around this stuff.\r\n\r\n@mikewest ",
