    "updated_at": "2017-05-05T15:05:41Z",
    "body": "As Boris noted, we're punycoding everything at the moment. I don't have any philosophical objection to Unicoding instead. That seems like a better result for folks outside the ASCII bubble.\r\n\r\nBut @sleevi has some concerns about exposing some Chrome internals in https://github.com/whatwg/url/issues/274#issuecomment-290713906 that I need to follow up on. I'll ping that internal thread to see whether progress has been made while I wasn't paying attention. :)",
