    "created_at": "2017-05-17T06:30:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-17T06:30:22Z",
    "body": "I will soon be moving ahead with removing the ability to serialize origins using IDNA ToUnicode on their host component (when the host is a domain).\r\n\r\nThe rationale is that this does not appear to be implemented in Chrome and Safari. And in Firefox it was implemented, but not in a way that matched the standard or would be predictable to web developers. Also, Firefox has a patch to align with Chrome and Safari per https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2568#issuecomment-300576361.\r\n\r\nTest coverage is tracked by the previous comment. Corresponding change to the URL Standard is here: https://github.com/whatwg/url/pull/311.",
